#: scenario2:scenario2_D22FE458_8A7D_4673_90FE_7646580B8285
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5c06d2d3d13920f9c0e07b8af466c9b7082919efb3a4c389194d0ef6a0280ece
#. default-sha256: c6e3f28520497d5a0030a4f8270dd89776fa59c761ea81fcfdb7f071287e098f
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D22FE458_8A7D_4673_90FE_7646580B8285"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫His psyche drifted erratically between human and beast."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫――남자의 정신은 ⟪k:4⟫사람과 짐승의 경계를 방황했습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_613DC2C4_840E_4A8F_9D57_5CAB67B354D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8c41d1c73435be756cbf43152efa41c7e0b7e216bae47205885fa9fc9c75fcca
#. default-sha256: 4007508d28bc4f76f7cd9277fd6fa8a63426466c8bcef8779d51722f5f5fedd2
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_613DC2C4_840E_4A8F_9D57_5CAB67B354D1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If he accepted himself as human, it might cause memories better left buried to return to him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫사람임을 인정하면 ⟪k:1⟫되찾아야 할 기억이 돌아올 수도 있습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_4E8DBE94_0F0F_455E_BD75_60909F199278
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 563a6845164d98e9785383ca968621e0a377ad7ebab02aeecf26214131e2dd9c
#. default-sha256: 9749ffd01ef9d4fa1004c545a47bb21f469fb67048bd2eb71f88aa43368f032e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_4E8DBE94_0F0F_455E_BD75_60909F199278"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If he accepted himself as a beast, in exchange for his memories,⟪k:1⟫he would no longer be "
"able to rejoin human society."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫짐승임을 인정하면 ⟪k:1⟫기억을 버리는 대신 ⟪k:2⟫인간 세상으로는 못 돌아갑니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_27E0A2EF_2853_4A32_A306_7FD78DEF8BD7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ec9f50425953cf924a89a4d71d37ae75b2b08f41133b4d7537876c0224535d98
#. default-sha256: cb9387c0323ad246ff4c6d525e4ef640a63f9c1473aed01d9d05dafb143767cd
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_27E0A2EF_2853_4A32_A306_7FD78DEF8BD7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl fervently supported him in these precarious times."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫백발 소녀는 ⟪k:1⟫그런 불안정한 남자를 끈기 있게 돌봐 주었습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_85DB32B0_F282_4C4F_AADE_25DF44D1793A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: da9693beca321f44b9405452e13382e17c0eb3a2945df7e304ffbea28a002b07
#. default-sha256: 852d36e24539e1ee3f777fde46fcf2b373ad98c94c828be56ee895050823415c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_85DB32B0_F282_4C4F_AADE_25DF44D1793A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was quite amazed. ⟪k:1⟫I had never imagined she would grow to be such a strong woman."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저는 놀랐습니다. ⟪k:1⟫소녀가 그토록 강해질 줄은 몰랐거든요."

#: scenario2:scenario2_81BAC672_0240_4367_B8F1_AEEE5EF63437
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cf56806a29e5361892f43b63e64c00630704049100ee5bebb7869a8a9e5d0857
#. default-sha256: 5121e180f25608ee4f25a831f0b00709b98fe7455cb70ddd2bb95502252672a2
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_81BAC672_0240_4367_B8F1_AEEE5EF63437"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nevertheless, God is a cruel master. ⟪k:1⟫For what strength He gave her spiritually, He took "
"in equal part from her physically."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫하지만 ⟪k:1⟫신께선 짓궂으시더군요.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫정신이 강해진 ⟪k:4⟫대가로 ⟪k:5⟫육체가 약해진 겁니"
"다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_05F0A744_A738_48CE_AC4F_1752BD288946
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0b81015d431b4948968eabc55e77964f9aa3129281195742f4660f1c29255969
#. default-sha256: e1c4c0437fe6eb587c14c2677e23034016f3311e18a12d887480a40ab3add873
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_05F0A744_A738_48CE_AC4F_1752BD288946"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though she persisted, day in and day out, to stay by the man’s side, one day, she suddenly "
"fell ill."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫끈기 있게 남자 곁에 있던 소녀는 ⟪k:1⟫어느 날 갑자기 ⟪k:2⟫쓰러졌습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_634710E0_4271_494D_8734_B73C81AB4A91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 89fac175bb1efc37ea2d143a9365a35a923d85edea6dfd0ba9dba3cf1fa57493
#. default-sha256: a25485dab7b4de3096cc911e056318143779d7a6f5c58e78821b953f7f9c8edc
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_634710E0_4271_494D_8734_B73C81AB4A91"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫With her in the throes of a high fever and not knowing the cause, he fell into a perpetual "
"panic."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫원인불명의 고열이 소녀를 좀먹자, ⟪k:1⟫남자는 ⟪k:2⟫우왕좌왕했습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_3AE81AF8_72E6_46B9_87D7_D2F4F26D2594
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 234948cb825415f5551cf69cb910f41c9fa4353ab03c7a0ce5ff1aff442bda9c
#. default-sha256: f3fbdee2dd63f60c2d8f00f05389189012f1b740188df8a3197984e44ee8adc3
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3AE81AF8_72E6_46B9_87D7_D2F4F26D2594"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There was no medicine in the mansion. ⟪k:1⟫They could hardly manage to put together "
"sufficiently nutritious meals."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저택에는 마땅한 약이 없습니다.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫영양가 있는 식사조차 성히 못 하니까요."

#: scenario2:scenario2_86C68658_873A_40A0_944A_3AFF8C8C15F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5a42add0b8191b148e6a5cd69550891927251f3438e0c2e4515a0d43943655ba
#. default-sha256: 503631ac7d58a7f4886feb35e5a47adc4ebb08cec12451a611f9f4c3167170fb
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_86C68658_873A_40A0_944A_3AFF8C8C15F3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though there was no medicine, maybe there was something else that could make her feel better."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫약이 없더라도 ⟪k:1⟫최소한 ⟪k:2⟫소녀를 기운 차리게 할 무언가가 있다면……."

#: scenario2:scenario2_781579D4_483E_40FE_AF37_18A0F7978D13
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 611bf39b820f4c99650adef64d57ddff786a6f4214451130dc04a1429e5fe8ce
#. default-sha256: ccf094b93c233711c50f3093cd58984e22774c0431673a753ad8a46c7cb8c1bf
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_781579D4_483E_40FE_AF37_18A0F7978D13"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫However, everything he could think of required him to leave the house."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그리 판단한 남자였으나, ⟪k:1⟫역시 ⟪k:2⟫그건 밖에서만 입수할 수 있는 것들입니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_FF92B370_1B1F_450C_8CEE_E0A7058049B4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5a31541db693002708bef9f5aa8e7e7d824582be2deb47b1d602a628cb7fde15
#. default-sha256: 04f1d092800627d3c650b769755a87a4660c03e4e2bc5a68997526560e1c00d3
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_FF92B370_1B1F_450C_8CEE_E0A7058049B4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Hey... ⟪k:10⟫Hey."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫이봐……, ⟪k:10⟫이봐."

#: scenario2:scenario2_3270703E_D7AD_4458_8C31_65257D00792F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e91e42b9ad8671e11a3fd29edbbee8d4881b7be72f925a4eb21194b41a083679
#. default-sha256: 2bf0ea6aa3c4527027e168a28f339cf100e6c24c254ac3e7f2d794d415bcecc6
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3270703E_D7AD_4458_8C31_65257D00792F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………."

#: scenario2:scenario2_001F0AE2_2F0B_404C_AA1A_D785C93AA9B9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d20f2f633414e60678d58fdf6052bca1b455582b3d59fa83f8d82fc7879265f1
#. default-sha256: d79c0c7a5925492eefd5212f0e3d7b58419bca1f0dfc538b4ed112ed61b0ef8e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_001F0AE2_2F0B_404C_AA1A_D785C93AA9B9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Is there anything you would like?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫뭐…… 필요한 건 없나."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A0151887_D25E_4A14_BE0E_3B9B75139582
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b52fe2d26a4b9a4ed50cc15ac5f5999cf94002823cf77d8d2de7bd5ecd4f3c1f
#. default-sha256: 94a76911ea73685365cfbca6c71e121b4aff985ffaf90ce483a64625203801b1
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A0151887_D25E_4A14_BE0E_3B9B75139582"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Anything... ⟪k:2⟫I would like...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫필요한…… ⟪k:2⟫거요……?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_675D2378_B607_43CE_8DAB_78E22BDD345D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 41dafca10ce8205786bf5ce84e115db8ba8b71155edeb41116890e573d42b41f
#. default-sha256: d9aa4c9ec2509a36b4c7394a0363a6bf7f39ffda19b37eb3a450b996e5cae33c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_675D2378_B607_43CE_8DAB_78E22BDD345D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I’m considering..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫마을로……………"

#: scenario2:scenario2_4C48DE42_33E8_45EB_82F7_FCF9CFA52535
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f6f3cbaefd96acca7a575ee580c3f89f325559353eb225bda4b9a6689c7f1a55
#. default-sha256: 0793e9a3aa156ff33259bf71bf68f4070fc9429560729d89cc5a1dc09598d6af
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_4C48DE42_33E8_45EB_82F7_FCF9CFA52535"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫visiting the village."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……가 보려…… ⟪k:2⟫한다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_5AA70BC1_FCF0_46EF_9164_F66F9D0A6DA0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9a7171e8d5b7cb874e1f5707344f85fcf1fa2f8ecec3a470cc83fad09b678cc0
#. default-sha256: 73e52eea387a9bea8b376d6eb13361778bf0fdaef7f751da005a05b1aaa83170
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_5AA70BC1_FCF0_46EF_9164_F66F9D0A6DA0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I see...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You’re going to the village..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그런가요……, ⟪k:2⟫마을로……… 가실 거군요………."

#: scenario2:scenario2_0E72AAEA_BFA9_466B_AAC8_843C1EAB28C9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3d5a7cdd55ac461d892265e6114199669557c30f9eb74ff8fd9bafa6e9a4b1c3
#. default-sha256: 5b5cac65315beb4d08e9997c06ffead811b620160c93051c9736626f19c3b39a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_0E72AAEA_BFA9_466B_AAC8_843C1EAB28C9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I thought I might be able to get some medicine."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫약을 찾아보려고………."

#: scenario2:scenario2_31BBE612_F46E_46E3_8340_8AC43F461A39
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e7e7b3e80cdd129cf56129c0077b75b293c868905f888e95b108f4621a8a4a3e
#. default-sha256: 5a3059ce29cc538b54b29fdf5841a4f391e6329c084db1f7c878e6b97a965d48
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_31BBE612_F46E_46E3_8340_8AC43F461A39"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I would prefer to bring a doctor here...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but no one would come if they learned you "
"were in this mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫의사를 왕진시키면 좋겠지만……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫저택 설명을 하면 ⟪k:3⟫올 리가 없지."

#: scenario2:scenario2_4837F3A8_618A_4A41_8BCA_9F65184841C2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4de431348aa0148d48d647b14a6cfb135caeccba6e75b79f15724722efc946fe
#. default-sha256: aff8159f283aa0789f41ee56e673cd92de8279d2ad47995ec1032fe22b7dcf46
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_4837F3A8_618A_4A41_8BCA_9F65184841C2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫So..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그러니………."

#: scenario2:scenario2_BF0A6369_E0B3_4637_8924_C2EC4BCA7C2F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 810e1914a2008254922232dc69c33050b53c6ceabb69599573d1c1c255b5ee79
#. default-sha256: 247e5f715a1d2efc457fe9e72f0b937028533a1f31bf02bab16311cce4e79a0e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_BF0A6369_E0B3_4637_8924_C2EC4BCA7C2F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He was planning to put on a disguise—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫to enter the village as a person."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫남자는 ⟪k:1⟫신분을 숨기고―― ⟪k:2⟫즉 사람으로서 ⟪k:3⟫마을로 가기로 했습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_7C2E41D3_243D_485A_BD38_AD1A0ADB69D8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 70a97130cb9c3a8b763b3393370411ed9847ff843a552d19699d90662a7341c0
#. default-sha256: 73542df6e460b9a3d36a8e2d660ecaf16d367185a764560a6091ee3444f68426
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7C2E41D3_243D_485A_BD38_AD1A0ADB69D8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl smiled when she heard his idea."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이 제안에 ⟪k:1⟫백발 소녀는 미소를 지었습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_C3594EDB_5862_465C_8F1E_DE54E325F513
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 343f2b5559c8a33d3098f08b59190ef2679e753ab326bb4d95c94813593103b0
#. default-sha256: 720a35d35d8ad9c9f53f12c7e77a61ff3fd48d27e95b4ae2907e7c3f0ac29d27
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C3594EDB_5862_465C_8F1E_DE54E325F513"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She had, after all, always wanted him to think of himself as human."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫소녀는 남자가 ⟪k:1⟫사람이란 자각을 가지길 바랐거든요."

#: scenario2:scenario2_70401842_E177_492C_93E8_5FA5249EBE4C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 804cc70ab3d8f891adb894e0b6e95f6ee78705937bb21601e4a6770cbfc64085
#. default-sha256: 30455e4405311c6bc0e06db73424b69482cd3af839e5cad44d1983c056d25c49
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_70401842_E177_492C_93E8_5FA5249EBE4C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫However, because she was so pure-hearted, she did not comprehend..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만 ⟪k:1⟫소녀는 선량하기 그지없어서―― 이해를 못 했습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_46DD207F_F77B_462E_AE51_E870377CD651
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6317ff0c56f8a695f6f785243bd56f417e7dc4e39aeb65d5c47d6e1e99f7eaa3
#. default-sha256: cdd2383daf1bcd564ff16d63c347c91e45502c38fc27caeeafa5d1cc0c404837
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_46DD207F_F77B_462E_AE51_E870377CD651"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫the full extent of the slaughter he had confessed to committing."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫남자가 고백한 살육이 ⟪k:1⟫실제로 얼마나 지독한 것이었는지를요."

#: scenario2:scenario2_05DDE8BA_3870_4B45_BA3C_233D3FC7144F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2ce558820bd25504ae0f1490a599a377d70822a1705d4cf4e5e50cd73759042f
#. default-sha256: f4da53bff1a4f1072704bb689b0caa31bb440a918ef023c38939061f423b2899
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_05DDE8BA_3870_4B45_BA3C_233D3FC7144F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The revenge he had taken on those who had chased him around.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫How sinister his "
"cackling and furious his reaping."
msgstr ""
